From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:26:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] others, misc, www: review 2026-10-07 - stock proxy links
 removed, the offline page's WAN poll trimmed

- rootprep: the stock proxy auto-configuration links into a temporary
  directory (served without a login) are no longer created.
- WAN_info.asp: the offline page's WAN poll now returns only the WAN state its
  one consumer reads, instead of also the dual-WAN list and auto-detect state.
The matching httpd table changes (pre-login rows compiled out or put behind a
login, archive wildcards behind a login) are in the httpd commit of this rung.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
